<!-- The macOS Quick Start as its own publication: its own site, print document and short PDF
     (content model, section 3). A root map sits at the root of the content folder, with every topic,
     key map and picture beneath it (DEC-045). The manual's own key maps come first, resource-only,
     so their keys take priority. The pages come from the shared map by mapref href, never by key. -->
